{"title":"BBCode","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><center>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"border:1px solid black; background:#CEE0F2;text-align:center;\" align=\"center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#B0C4DE;\"><b><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">BBCode</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">BBCode</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=BBCode:Tutorial\" title=\"BBCode:Tutorial\">Tutorial</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_BBCodes\" title=\"List of BBCodes\">List of BBCodes</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Aops_font\" title=\"Aops font\">AoPS Font</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></center>\n<h1><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"About\">About</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=BBCode&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: About\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<p><b>BBCode</b> is a markup language used in the AoPS forums.\n</p>\n<h1><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Tutorial\">Tutorial</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=BBCode&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Tutorial\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<p>See the tutorial <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=BBCode:Tutorial\" title=\"BBCode:Tutorial\"> here</a>.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018040355\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 10/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 295/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion tim